# Copy to local/opnsense-api.env (gitignored) and fill in from
# the OPNsense web UI. Create a DEDICATED user for the agent first
# (do not hang keys off root/admin):
#   1. System > Access > Groups > + : group "agents" (start with the
#      admins group for v1; OPNsense group privileges can scope it
#      down later)
#   2. System > Access > Users > + : user "agent" (set a password;
#      assign the agents group)
#   3. Edit the agent user > API keys > create keypair
# NEVER commit this file; never paste the secret into chat -- this
# file is the only place it lives. The keypair is revocable on its
# own without touching any human account.
OPNSENSE_HOST=192.168.1.1
OPNSENSE_KEY=paste-agent-api-key-here
OPNSENSE_SECRET=paste-agent-api-secret-here
